{"steam_appid":5064340,"steam_name":"DinoBones: Tidy Up the Museum","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/5064340/260610679/b155164ac6fdf25b86e706cf978a080a4864b267/1789748785/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790241900","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257426543/5d4c586c5e1385ca47f5cb5ed572cc2e44e12dbb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790241900","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/252b1086807dca8c179799bc9ba68d7907953fd5/ss_252b1086807dca8c179799bc9ba68d7907953fd5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791107014","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/42e2fa46c2df01687bfb1ee3a32ddb6a0bc12ed6/ss_42e2fa46c2df01687bfb1ee3a32ddb6a0bc12ed6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791107014","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/2c572d30766850ded482588d7ca423c828c33529/ss_2c572d30766850ded482588d7ca423c828c33529.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791107014","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/2cdb8bfb61da8780d10595ee8ed1830b3ff4e3d8/ss_2cdb8bfb61da8780d10595ee8ed1830b3ff4e3d8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791107014","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/c18b1b2dfc3a87d32312f30501e8a6ad53de78cf/ss_c18b1b2dfc3a87d32312f30501e8a6ad53de78cf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791107014"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Museum messed up! Something happened here. Crates are tipped over, and skulls, ribs, and vertebrae lie scattered across the halls. You're the only one around to put nine skeletons back together. Well, you and a cat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TURN CHAOS INTO ORDER</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/715ff5111a21958f5c9645516f23910a.poster.avif?t=1791107014\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/715ff5111a21958f5c9645516f23910a.webm?t=1791107014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/715ff5111a21958f5c9645516f23910a.mp4?t=1791107014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collect - </strong>Pick up bones from the floor, the stairs, and wherever the crates spilled them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Identify - </strong>Every bone starts as “Unknown”. Figure out which skeleton it belongs to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Assemble - </strong>Find the right slot and click it into place, one bone at a time</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MAKE A MESS, LEARN THE BONES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/bc56699936449806e9765f3c0466bb05.poster.avif?t=1791107014\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/bc56699936449806e9765f3c0466bb05.webm?t=1791107014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/bc56699936449806e9765f3c0466bb05.mp4?t=1791107014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Open crates, tip them over, or just throw them, and start rebuilding. Each dinosaur's bones have their own look, color, texture, wear, and the more you place them, the faster you recognize them. No skill trees, no upgrades. Just you getting better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WAKE UP THE MUSEUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/bc02e9c3916ae717795cadde275e50c3.poster.avif?t=1791107014\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/bc02e9c3916ae717795cadde275e50c3.webm?t=1791107014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5064340/extras/bc02e9c3916ae717795cadde275e50c3.mp4?t=1791107014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As skeletons come together, you'll trigger special events around the museum. Each one leaves something behind: little rewards, toys, and surprises that make the place feel like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 Ti 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 6500 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 / AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Indie Souls Studio"],"publishers":["Indie Souls Studio"],"release_date":"Sep 25, 2026"}